      "message": "\"then we restart it\" - we\u0027re freezing and then killing here all inside the same lock lifetime, right?  Any component lifecycle operations that might try to launch a process for this uid will be locked out for the duration of the freeze-then-kill, at which point all of the ProcessRecord bookkeeping for that uid should be gone, and no inherited process(es) carried over to a new lifecycle.\n\nNo?",
